      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "OMYBACNKNEES JUDGE (2) ran third last start at this track over 2200m, beaten 17 metres. Talented and has plenty of upside. Will enjoy a nice run from this favourable starting position. Beautifully placed and is sure to play a major role. A DRAGON FOR JOE (3) continued his impressive run of recent efforts last time out when runner-up over 2200m at this track, beaten 16 metres. Likely to get all the favours from this nice draw. Beautifully placed and is sure to play a major role again. IFYOULOVEMELETMEGO (4) disappointed last time when tenth over 1609m at Hobart. Can bounce back. JET TO HEAVEN (10) found form and finished in the money two runs ago then came back to earth when he broke and finished tenth last start over 1690m at Kilmore, coming home 35 metres from the winner. Hard to know where he gets from this slightly awkward draw. Facing a tougher assignment but a big run is possible if his race manners improve.",
